<!-- Why Us Section -->
<section id="how" class="section why-us light-background" data-builder="section"
    style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d0d1a 0%, #1a0033 100%); color: #e0e0f0;">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="row gy-4">
            <div
                class="col-lg-7 d-flex flex-column justify-content-center order-2 order-lg-1">
                <div class="content px-xl-5" data-aos="fade-up"
                    data-aos-delay="100">
                    <h2 style="color: #ff00ff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff00ff;">
                        🛠️ How We Roll</h2>
                    <p style="color: #ccccff;">
                        Semua project kita dijalankan lewat GitHub dengan alur
                        kerja yang mengadopsi best practice
                        industri. Fokus kita: kolaborasi rapi, kode bersih, dan
                        flow kerja yang smooth.
                        Kita pakai branching system yang terstruktur, pull
                        request yang jelas, dan komunikasi aktif
                        lewat GitHub dan Discord.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-container px-xl-5" data-aos="fade-up"
                    data-aos-delay="200">
                    <h3 style="color: #00ffff; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ffff;">
                        🔰 The Lowdown on Joining</h3>
                    <div class="faq-item faq-active"
                        style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.3); transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                        <h3 style="color: #00ffff;"><span>01</span> Perlu akun
                            GitHub, ya?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p style="color: #ccccff;">Yup! Kamu wajib punya
                                akun GitHub aktif. Idealnya udah ada
                                sedikit aktivitas di profilmu, walau cuma proyek
                                iseng. Ini bukti kamu familiar sama
                                platformnya.</p>
                        </div>
                        <i class="faq-toggle bi bi-chevron-right"
                            style="color:#00ffff;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item"
                        style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.3); transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                        <h3 style="color: #00ffff;"><span>02</span> Apa aja
                            dasar Git yang perlu dikuasai?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p style="color: #ccccff;">
                                Kamu harus paham dasar seperti:<br>
                                <code>git clone</code>, <code>git add</code>,
                                <code>git commit</code>,
                                <code>git push</code>, <code>git pull</code>,
                                <code>git branch</code>,
                                <code>merge</code>, <code>rebase</code>.
                                <br><br>
                                Plus, tau cara handle merge conflict itu nilai
                                plus!
                            </p>
                        </div><i class="faq-toggle bi bi-chevron-right"
                            style="color:#00ffff;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item"
                        style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.3); transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                        <h3 style="color: #00ffff;"><span>03</span> Gimana cara
                            kontribusi kodenya?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p style="color: #ccccff;">
                                Semua kontribusi harus lewat <strong>Pull
                                    Request</strong> di GitHub. Pastikan kodenya
                                bersih, deskripsi PR-nya jelas, dan siap
                                direview. Komunikasi aktif di kolom PR juga
                                penting banget.
                            </p>
                        </div><i class="faq-toggle bi bi-chevron-right"
                            style="color:#00ffff;"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-item"
                        style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,255,255,0.3); transition: all 0.3s ease;">
                        <h3 style="color: #00ffff;"><span>04</span> Harus aktif
                            ngobrol juga?</h3>
                        <div class="faq-content">
                            <p style="color: #ccccff;">
                                Definitely. Kita aktifin komunikasi lewat GitHub
                                Discussions dan Discord. Semangat
                                ngobrol, nanya, dan berbagi ilmu itu yang bikin
                                komunitas kita hidup dan berkembang.
                            </p>
                        </div><i class="faq-toggle bi bi-chevron-right"
                            style="color:#00ffff;"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5 order-1 order-lg-2 why-us-img">
                <img src="assets/img/animation/hero-img2.webp" class="img-fluid"
                    alt="" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100"
                    style="max-width:100%; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px #00ffff);">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>